# The build context is the wheel's inputs and nothing else. Everything the
# Dockerfile COPYs is listed there explicitly; this keeps the rest -- the
# checkout's own environment, tests, examples, caches -- from being sent to
# the daemon and from invalidating the build cache when it changes.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!README.md
!LICENSE
!src/
src/**/__pycache__/
src/**/*.py[cod]
